        "id": 1959861
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-23T21:42:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Host stack has to send signal for success case to BluetoothSocket waiting for accept(). If we implement like following, it could be confused when we have to send success signal to BluetoothSocket in framework.\n\n```\nsetup SUCCESS -\u003e nothing to report, host already assumes success\nsetup FAILURE -\u003e HAL calls IBluetoothSocketCallbacks.close() with documenting reason string\n```",
      "parentUuid": "15604042_0360e158",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 29,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "4ba8aa28cc934ff69d1503e59696c2ceae62b1c2",
